mpty; unrelated paths retain their prepared state.","resume-push":"The authorized effect commit remains local HEAD and equals remote branch head; no new local commit was created."},"source_corrections":["Replace free repository paths and remote names with trusted repository/remote registry keys and materialized manifest sets.","Require and atomically consume an exact publication-authorization receipt for every mutating mode; contract approval alone never authorizes publication.","Add a deterministic Prevention-Effect-ID commit trailer and journaled stage receipts so a crash after commit or push can be reconciled without duplication.","Split long integration modes into progressively reserved typed stages and terminalize only after local/remote/source semantic re-observation.","Route no-argument operator use through shared semantic intake; reject operator-authored argv, derive manifests and flags in the registered adapter, show the prepared operation before dispatch, and require a separate confirmation for every mutating profile."]},"policy_sha256":"ea44075de3dffee0827fb1bb027bc87396f01ba0f82247b878a80a7a039f2c3d","required_clause_ids":["05834d24b1d86e574cfb2f1977455fefbf724365778f6bd5eb9c76c95984fd8e","05faa60d66b5a07f7b49d286bc31e6663249222b44a3fcebc444bebbed7edd79","29fa9eed3e945c0c222849a7f04256031951759ac07b5bb8bb11e5c0f5f9c307","2a7cf0a77a2084aacdf5471035d4e532b3aa18e8fc05ce8d94e89bc58ee0b9d5","2f3fa343b1ee07a6143a72c3cded59a819ccecf23434fec8840d80727e2f5d74","33855d03458218260d19b500e193017c2ed203996227ef92276bc125b6eb91d1","aa11c00af4df037cc75dd796c2eb31dcb9319942e3c404423d199906314a24cd","abbb693fb37730fd94817e898bd227506f93e534e6356ca014bf6b95c9471d41","e04f4b7f6cc0dd2d16502c1c67b84ec0244dca61f3b79063aec442d6bd05f470","faa7a313cc53e4b2b976c05dc5cece217b0efd1c4a11668bf96eb17a771dc393"],"result_kinds":["EXECUTED_RESULT","RECOVERED_RESULT"],"semantic_observation_fields":["effect_id","evidence","observed_at_utc","owner_sequence_id","preparation_artifact_sha256",